      "description": "紙白結果面透過對齊區分明細與總價。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-summary\" aria-label=\"試算結果\"><dl class=\"ds-breakdown\"><div><dt>計費 30 分鐘 × NT$15</dt><dd>NT$450</dd></div></dl><div class=\"ds-total\"><span>預估費用</span><output>NT$450</output></div><p>總額四捨五入至整元，實際依試聽後正式報價為準。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-summary{font-family:var(--sans,\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif);padding:22px 24px;background:var(--paper,#f6f7f2);color:var(--ink,#173f35);border-radius:0;line-height:1.8}.ds-breakdown{margin:0 0 18px;font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-breakdown div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding-block:3px}.ds-breakdown dd{margin:0;white-space:nowrap}.ds-total{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.ds-total output{font-size:36px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-summary p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#496258);line-height:1.7;margin:10px 0 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "閱讀式 FAQ",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "直接展開的問題與回答，以字重和間距建立閱讀層次。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-faq\"><h3>只提供 SRT 嗎？</h3><p>是，目前只提供繁體中文 SRT 檔案，內含每段逐字稿的起訖時間。可用文字編輯器閱讀，或匯入支援 SRT 的播放器及剪輯工具。</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-faq{font-family:var(--sans,\"Noto Sans TC\",\"PingFang TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",sans-serif);background:var(--paper,#f6f7f2);color:var(--ink,#173f35);max-width:520px;line-height:1.8}.ds-faq h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 9px}.ds-faq p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted,#496258);margin:0}"
    },
